      "REVEREND MOTHER MOHIAM: Pain.\nREVEREND MOTHER MOHIAM: No need to call the guards. Your mother stands outside that door.\nREVEREND MOTHER MOHIAM: No one will get past her.\nJESSICA: I must not fear. Fear is the mind- killer. Fear is the little death that brings obliteration.",
